WEBVTT

00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:12.572
It's beautiful, isn't it?
The moon.

00:00:13.486 --> 00:00:15.532
Divine.

00:00:15.575 --> 00:00:17.969
Had ourselves a little
late-night snack, did we?

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:20.101
It was on your bed, the box.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.669
I just thought I'd try one.

00:00:22.713 --> 00:00:24.410
Or 20.

00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:26.325
I can't stop thinking
about her, Harry.

00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:28.501
Honestly, I reckoned
she was annoying you.

00:00:28.545 --> 00:00:31.025
She could never annoy me.

00:00:32.679 --> 00:00:34.376
I think I love her.

00:00:37.815 --> 00:00:40.252
Well, brilliant.

00:00:43.951 --> 00:00:46.127
Do you think she knows I exist?

00:00:46.171 --> 00:00:48.390
I hope so. She's been
snogging you for three months.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:51.480
Snogging?
Who are you talking about?

00:00:51.524 --> 00:00:53.613
Who are you talking about?

00:00:53.657 --> 00:00:58.052
Romilda, of course.
Romilda Vane.

00:00:58.096 --> 00:00:59.706
Okay, very funny.

00:01:02.709 --> 00:01:04.058
What was that for?

00:01:04.102 --> 00:01:06.539
It's no joke!
I'm in love with her!

00:01:06.583 --> 00:01:09.542
Fine, you're in love with her.
Have you ever actually met her?

00:01:09.586 --> 00:01:13.502
No. Can you introduce me?

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:25.993
[♪♪♪]

00:01:35.046 --> 00:01:36.830
Come on, Ron.

00:01:36.874 --> 00:01:39.267
I'm gonna introduce
you to Romilda Vane.

00:01:48.102 --> 00:01:49.103
[KNOCKING]

00:01:49.974 --> 00:01:51.279
HARRY:
I'm sorry, sir.

00:01:51.323 --> 00:01:52.759
I wouldn't bother you
if it weren't

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:54.587
absolutely essential.

00:01:54.631 --> 00:01:56.676
RON:
Where's Romilda?

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.504
What's the matter with Wenby?

00:01:58.547 --> 00:02:00.201
[WHISPERS]
Very powerful love potion.

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:03.683
SLUGHORN:
Very well. Better bring him in.

00:02:03.727 --> 00:02:05.250
I'd have thought
you could whip up

00:02:05.293 --> 00:02:07.121
a remedy for this
in no time, Harry.

00:02:07.165 --> 00:02:10.211
Well, I thought this called
for a more practiced hand, sir.

00:02:10.255 --> 00:02:13.475
Hello, darling.
Fancy a drink?

00:02:13.519 --> 00:02:15.303
Perhaps you're right.

00:02:19.699 --> 00:02:21.527
HARRY:
I'm sorry, by the way,
professor,

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:25.226
about earlier today, our--
Our misunderstanding.

00:02:25.270 --> 00:02:29.753
Oh, not at all. All water under
the bridge, you know? Correct?

00:02:29.796 --> 00:02:32.843
I expect you're tired
of it after all these years.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:35.628
All the questions
about Voldemort.

00:02:35.672 --> 00:02:37.630
Don't use that name.

00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:42.722
[THUDS]

00:02:45.203 --> 00:02:47.422
SLUGHORN:
There you are, old boy.
Bottoms up.

00:02:47.466 --> 00:02:50.687
What's this?Tonic for the nerves.

00:03:05.005 --> 00:03:05.963
What happened to me?

00:03:06.006 --> 00:03:07.529
Love potion.

00:03:07.573 --> 00:03:09.793
A bloody strong one at that.

00:03:09.836 --> 00:03:11.882
I feel really bad.

00:03:11.925 --> 00:03:14.014
SLUGHORN:
You need a pick-me-up, my boy.

00:03:14.058 --> 00:03:17.844
Got Butterbeer, wine,
dazzling oak-matured mead.

00:03:17.888 --> 00:03:19.890
I had other intentions for this,

00:03:19.933 --> 00:03:21.935
but I think,
given the circumstances...

00:03:24.546 --> 00:03:26.374
Here we are, Potter.

00:03:26.418 --> 00:03:28.072
To life!

00:03:32.685 --> 00:03:33.817
HARRY:Ron.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:35.819
[GAGGING]

00:03:35.862 --> 00:03:40.737
Ron. Professor, do something.

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:42.564
SLUGHORN:
I don't understand.

00:03:58.798 --> 00:04:00.713
Come on, Ron, breathe.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.771
[COUGHING]

00:04:22.822 --> 00:04:25.782
These girls,
they're gonna kill me.

00:04:36.662 --> 00:04:40.144
Quick thinking on your part,
Harry, using a bezoar.

00:04:40.187 --> 00:04:42.711
You must be very proud
of your student, Horace.

00:04:42.755 --> 00:04:46.280
Hm? Oh, yes, very proud.

00:04:46.324 --> 00:04:49.196
I think we agree,
Potter's actions were heroic.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:53.374
The question is,
why were they necessary?

00:04:53.418 --> 00:04:55.289
Why, indeed?

00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:57.465
This appears to be a gift,
Horace.

00:04:57.509 --> 00:05:00.642
You don't remember
who gave you this bottle?

00:05:00.686 --> 00:05:02.688
Which, by the way,
possesses remarkably subtle

00:05:02.731 --> 00:05:07.388
hints of licorice and cherry
when not polluted with poison.

00:05:07.432 --> 00:05:10.696
SLUGHORN:
Actually, I had intended
to give it as a gift myself.

00:05:10.739 --> 00:05:12.219
DUMBLEDORE:
To whom, I might ask?

00:05:13.917 --> 00:05:16.789
To you, Headmaster.

00:05:17.921 --> 00:05:19.313
LAVENDER:
Where is he?

00:05:19.357 --> 00:05:23.230
Where's my Won-Won?
Has he been asking for me?

00:05:27.278 --> 00:05:28.627
What's she doing here?

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.064
I might ask you
the same question.

00:05:31.108 --> 00:05:33.458
I happen to be his girlfriend.

00:05:33.501 --> 00:05:36.417
I happen to be his...friend.

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:41.422
Don't make me laugh.
You haven't spoken in weeks.

00:05:41.466 --> 00:05:45.296
I suppose you want to make up
now that he's all interesting.

00:05:45.339 --> 00:05:48.125
He's been poisoned,
you daft dimbo!

00:05:48.168 --> 00:05:49.430
And for the record,

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.954
I've always found
him interesting.

00:05:50.997 --> 00:05:51.955
[GASPS]

00:05:51.998 --> 00:05:58.048
Ah. See? He senses my presence.

00:05:58.091 --> 00:06:01.529
Don't worry, Won-Won.
I'm here.

00:06:01.573 --> 00:06:04.010
I'm here.

00:06:05.664 --> 00:06:07.709
[MUMBLES]

00:06:09.755 --> 00:06:13.063
RON:
Uh... Hermione...

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:19.721
Hermione.

00:06:19.765 --> 00:06:22.115
Hermione.

00:06:26.815 --> 00:06:29.557
[LAVENDER SOBBING]

00:06:29.601 --> 00:06:33.822
Oh, to be young,
and to feel love's keen sting.

00:06:33.866 --> 00:06:35.650
Well, come away, everybody.

00:06:35.694 --> 00:06:38.653
Mr. Weasley is well tended.

00:06:43.223 --> 00:06:45.138
About time, don't you think?

00:06:48.446 --> 00:06:50.361
Thank you.

00:06:52.972 --> 00:06:54.931
Oh, shut up.

00:06:54.974 --> 00:06:56.541
[DOOR SHUTS]

00:06:56.584 --> 00:06:58.847
[♪♪♪]

